   "fix": "Say that the example shows composition fails in `W^{1,p}` (as the `HasWeakFDerivOn.sq` docstring at line 276 does). Or give a real counterexample to the weak statement, e.g. an unbounded `u` with `g = exp`, so that `g \u2218 u` is not locally integrable.",
